  "files": [
    {
      "path": "index.html",
      "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n  <title>Pixel BMI Calculator</title>\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"styles.css\">\n</head>\n<body>\n  <main class=\"card\">\n    <h1>BMI Calculator</h1>\n    <form id=\"bmi-form\">\n      <div class=\"input-group\">\n        <label for=\"height\">Height (cm)</label>\n        <input type=\"number\" id=\"height\" name=\"height\" min=\"1\" step=\"any\" required placeholder=\"e.g., 170\">\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"input-group\">\n        <label for=\"weight\">Weight (kg)</label>\n        <input type=\"number\" id=\"weight\" name=\"weight\" min=\"1\" step=\"any\" required placeholder=\"e.g., 65\">\n      </div>\n      <button type=\"submit\" id=\"calculate\">Calculate</button>\n    </form>\n    <div id=\"result\" class=\"result\" aria-live=\"polite\">\n      <p class=\"bmi-value\">Your BMI: <span id=\"bmi-value\">--</span></p>\n      <p class=\"bmi-category\">Category: <span id=\"bmi-category\">--</span></p>\n    </div>\n  </main>\n  <script src=\"script.js\"></script>\n</body>\n</html>",
      "description": ""
    },
    {
      "path": "styles.css",
      "content": ":root {\n  --color-bg: #f0f4f8;\n  --color-card: #ffffff;\n  --color-primary: #2c3e50;\n  --color-accent: #3498db;\n  --color-accent-hover: #2980b9;\n  --color-text: #2c3e50;\n  --color-text-light: #7f8c8d;\n  --color-error: #e74c3c;\n  --color-success: #27ae60;\n  --radius: 12px;\n  --shadow: 0 8px 24px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.08);\n}\n\n* {\n  box-sizing: border-box;\n  margin: 0;\n  padding: 0;\n}\n\nbody {\n  font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, sans-serif;\n  font-size: 16px;\n  line-height: 1.5;\n  background: linear-gradient(135deg, #e0eafc 0%, #cfdef3 100%);\n  min-height: 100vh;\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  justify-content: center;\n  padding: 16px;\n  color: var(--color-text);\n}\n\n.card {\n  background: var(--color-card);\n  border-radius: var(--radius);\n  box-shadow: var(--shadow);\n  padding: 32px 24px;\n  width: 100%;\n  max-width: 400px;\n}\n\nh1 {\n  font-size: 1.75rem;\n  font-weight: 700;\n  margin-bottom: 24px;\n  text-align: center;\n  color: var(--color-primary);\n}\n\n.input-group {\n  margin-bottom: 20px;\n}\n\nlabel {\n  display: block;\n  font-weight: 600;\n  margin-bottom: 6px;\n  color: var(--color-text);\n}\n\ninput[type=\"number\"] {\n  width: 100%;\n  padding: 12px 14px;\n  font-size: 1rem;\n  border: 2px solid #dce1e6;\n  border-radius: 8px;\n  transition: border-color 0.2s, box-shadow 0.2s;\n  background: #fafbfc;\n}\n\ninput[type=\"number\"]:focus {\n  outline: none;\n  border-color: var(--color-accent);\n  box-shadow: 0 0 0 3px rgba(52, 152, 219, 0.2);\n  background: #fff;\n}\n\ninput[type=\"number\"]:hover {\n  border-color: #b0bec5;\n}\n\nbutton {\n  width: 100%;\n  padding: 14px;\n  font-size: 1.1rem;\n  font-weight: 600;\n  color: #fff;\n  background: var(--color-accent);\n  border: none;\n  border-radius: 8px;\n  cursor: pointer;\n  transition: background 0.2s, transform 0.1s;\n  margin-top: 8px;\n}\n\nbutton:hover {\n  background: var(--color-accent-hover);\n}\n\nbutton:focus-visible {\n  outline: 3px solid var(--color-accent);\n  outline-offset: 2px;\n}\n\nbutton:active {\n  transform: scale(0.98);\n}\n\n.result {\n  margin-top: 24px;\n  padding: 16px;\n  background: #f8f9fa;\n  border-radius: 8px;\n  text-align: center;\n  font-size: 1.1rem;\n}\n\n.bmi-value {\n  font-size: 1.5rem;\n  font-weight: 700;\n  color: var(--color-primary);\n  margin-bottom: 4px;\n}\n\n.bmi-category {\n  font-size: 1.1rem;\n  color: var(--color-text-light);\n}\n\n.bmi-category span {\n  font-weight: 600;\n  color: var(--color-primary);\n}\n\n.error {\n  color: var(--color-error);\n  font-weight: 600;\n}\n\n@media (max-width: 400px) {\n  .card {\n    padding: 24px 16px;\n  }\n  h1 {\n    font-size: 1.5rem;\n  }\n  button {\n    font-size: 1rem;\n  }\n}",
      "description": ""
    },
    {
      "path": "script.js",
      "content": "document.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded', () => {\n  const form = document.getElementById('bmi-form');\n  const heightInput = document.getElementById('height');\n  const weightInput = document.getElementById('weight');\n  const bmiValueSpan = document.getElementById('bmi-value');\n  const bmiCategorySpan = document.getElementById('bmi-category');\n  const resultDiv = document.getElementById('result');\n\n  form.addEventListener('submit', (e) => {\n    e.preventDefault();\n    calculateBMI();\n  });\n\n  function calculateBMI() {\n    const heightCm = parseFloat(heightInput.value);\n    const weightKg = parseFloat(weightInput.value);\n\n    if (isNaN(heightCm) || isNaN(weightKg) || heightCm <= 0 || weightKg <= 0) {\n      bmiValueSpan.textContent = '--';\n      bmiCategorySpan.textContent = '--';\n      bmiCategorySpan.className = 'error';\n      bmiCategorySpan.textContent = 'Please enter valid positive numbers.';\n      return;\n    }\n\n    const heightM = heightCm / 100;\n    const bmi = weightKg / (heightM * heightM);\n    const bmiRounded = bmi.toFixed(1);\n\n    let category = '';\n    if (bmi < 18.5) {\n      category = 'Underweight';\n    } else if (bmi < 25) {\n      category = 'Normal';\n    } else if (bmi < 30) {\n      category = 'Overweight';\n    } else {\n      category = 'Obese';\n    }\n\n    bmiValueSpan.textContent = bmiRounded;\n    bmiCategorySpan.textContent = category;\n    bmiCategorySpan.className = '';\n  }\n});",
      "description": ""
    },
    {
      "path": "README.md",
      "content": "# Pixel BMI Calculator\n\nA simple, offline BMI calculator built with HTML, CSS, and plain JavaScript.\n\n## Features\n\n- Input height in centimeters and weight in kilograms.\n- Calculates BMI and displays it to one decimal place.\n- Shows the BMI category: Underweight, Normal, Overweight, or Obese.\n- Responsive design, works from 360px wide.\n- Keyboard accessible with visible focus states.\n- No external dependencies or network requests.\n\n## Usage\n\nOpen `index.html` in any modern browser. Enter your height and weight, then click \"Calculate\" or press Enter.\n\n## Categories\n\n- Underweight: BMI < 18.5\n- Normal: 18.5 ≤ BMI < 25\n- Overweight: 25 ≤ BMI < 30\n- Obese: BMI ≥ 30\n\n## License\n\nMIT",
      "description": ""
    }
  ]
}